  "change_kinds": [
    {
      "id": "apps-workflows",
      "name": "Apps, workflows and agents",
      "who": "app builders in a workspace",
      "main": true,
      "reach": 2,
      "evidence": "Builders change apps and workflows on the canvas with debug runs, then publish; the workflow generator drafts or refines a whole graph for the builder to apply (api/controllers/console/app/generator.py:482-571, api/services/workflow_generator_service.py:45-98), and in agent build mode the agent writes its own configuration into a per-user build draft that a person applies (api/services/agent_config_service.py:913-929, 968-983; apply at api/controllers/console/agent/roster.py:953). Undo: restore any published workflow version to the draft and publish it (api/services/workflow_service.py:622, api/controllers/console/app/workflow.py:1557) and restore an agent version (roster.py:1302, roster_service.py:1450). Reach 2 rests on DEL-04 2.",
      "confidence": "high",
      "reach_name": "Drafted"
    },
    {
      "id": "prompts",
      "name": "What the AI is told to do (prompts and instructions)",
      "who": "app builders",
      "main": true,
      "reach": 2,
      "evidence": "Builders edit prompts in apps, LLM nodes and agents; the prompt and instruction generators draft them on request (api/controllers/console/app/generator.py:230, :327; api/core/llm_generator/llm_generator.py). Undo: prompts in workflows and agents roll back with their published versions (workflow_service.py:622, roster.py:1302). In basic chat and completion apps each save writes a new model configuration row (api/controllers/console/app/model_config.py:68) but there is no path to restore an earlier one, so undo there is by hand.",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "reach_name": "Drafted"
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge",
      "name": "Knowledge the apps answer from",
      "who": "app builders and knowledge owners",
